    "Authorities also announced the disruption of international online fraud operations, highlighting broader efforts to address criminal activity."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto, accompanied by Minister of Home Affairs Tito Karnavian, oversaw the state-sanctioned destruction of 601.7 tons of narcotics seized by the Indonesian National Police (Polri). Officials stated the massive haul is valued at 61.68 trillion rupiah and noted that the initiative is intended to protect millions of citizens from the impacts of drug consumption. During the event, the Chief of National Police affirmed a commitment to pursuing major drug traffickers and investigating any internal personnel found to be complicit in criminal activities. Beyond narcotics enforcement, the authorities concurrently addressed the exposure of international online fraud syndicates. Legislative figures have expressed support for these measures, urging continued enforcement to target the leadership within drug trafficking networks, while law enforcement agencies simultaneously implement rehabilitation programs for those affected by substance abuse.",
